An '''abyssal demon''' is a [[power level]] 4 mini boss monster that can be found wandering the [[Whispering Swamp]], [[Fractured Plains]] and [[Bloodblight Swamp]].

==Location==
Although it cannot be consistently found there, there is a rare chance for an abyssal demon to spawn in the north-eastern [[Fractured Plains]].
{{Map|Abyssal Demon}}

