==Trivia==
* Their appearance leans towards the ''Old School RuneScape'' design of the abyssal demon, specifically the [[osrsw:Greater abyssal demon|greater abyssal demon]].
** Although they appear to resemble the greater abyssal demon, they are actually much larger than them.
* According to the game's file, there is no spawn point for the abyssal demons in the Fractures Plain, making these seemingly bugged, spawn points. 

