'''Cooking''' is one of the [[skills]] in ''Runescape: Dragonwilds'' and allows players to prepare [[food]] and [[drink]]s.  Consuming these items can provide [[sustenance]], [[hydration]], and [[health]], as well as provide temporary [[perks]]. Higher levels decrease the chances of burning higher-level ingredients.

==Crafting Stations==
* {{plink|Campfire}} (requires a fuel source)
* {{plink|Grill}}
* {{plink|Stone Range}}
* {{plink|Cooking Range}}

