==Update history==
{{UH|
{{UL
|type = update
|date = [[23 June]] [[2026]]
|ver = Eye on Ashenfall - 0.12.0
|update = [[Umbral Sands]] released, bringing new ingredients and recipes. Although the raw fish are listed as Power Level 7 ingredients, when cooked, they end up as Power Level 4. The raw and cooked [[cactus steak]], however, are both listed as Power Level 5 ingredients. [[Tea leaves]] do not have a listed Power Level and are instead [[Dried Tea Leaves|dried]] in a [[kiln]] and then [[Ground Tea Leaves|ground]] in a [[grindstone]].
}}
{{UL
|type = update
|date = [[21 April]] [[2026]]
|ver = Eye on Ashenfall - 0.11.1
|update = Fishing was added, bringing a variety of new ingredients and recipes for Cooking. Originally, fish from Fellhollow were Power Level 5, and fish from Dowdun Reach were Power Level 6, but both types were lowered to Power Level 4 in later hotfixes.
}}
{{UL
|type = update
|date = [[31 March]] [[2026]]
|ver = 0.11 is live now! Enter Dowdun Reach...
|vernum = 0.11.0
|update = The skill caps were raised to 99 and the power levels of ingredients were adjusted, as well as the Cooking level required to cook them without burning. A number of new ingredients and recipes for the Cooking Range were added.
}}
{{UL
|type = update
|date = [[29 September]] [[2025]]
|ver = Eye on Ashenfall - 0.9.1
|update = 
* The Cooking skill was reworked with the following:
** The Cooking Pot was replaced with the Stone Range.
** Several more foods were introduced into the game to balance the sustenance and perks that already existed in the game.
** Delicious food was removed, including the delicious versions of Wild Pie, Kebab, and Meat Pizza.
}}
{{UL
|type = patch
|date = [[17 June]] [[2025]]
