A '''crimson crybaby''' is a [[mount]] unlocked by studying the [[MOUNT: crimson crybaby]] vestige, which can be obtained as a drop from [[red dragon]]s, [[KotHaar-Kal]], [[kalphite guardian]]s and [[Chest (Umbral Sands)|chests]] found in [[Umbral Sands]].

==Item sources==
{{Drop sources list|MOUNT: Crimson Crybaby}}

==Description & Abilities==
{{Mount
|description =
A breed created by a Zamorakian priest who found them far less terrifying than he had hoped. Instead of bringing fear to the masses, these terrorbirds would whimper and sob whenever forced to do any manual labour. He named the breed “crybaby” in frustration, though it remains disappointingly apt.
|ability = Equip
|carry_weight = +200
}}

