[[File:Garou King Standard.png|250px|right|thumb|The Standard and heraldry for the Garou King.]]

The '''Garou King''' is a [[power level]] 5 mini-boss [[Monsters|monster]] located at the [[Highlands Castle]].

He has a large tower shield to protect himself. When attacked, he will block all attacks until their stance is broken, staggering him for a very short period. Shortly after his stance is broken, he will attack and be immune to getting staggered. He has an attack that could kill the player with one hit.

Players must defeat a Garou King to receive the [[tainted king's token]] needed for the [[Dog Days]] quest.

