==Walkthrough==
{{Needed|One [[opal]], one [[jade]], and one [[sapphire]]}}
The activity requires the player to find three statues of [[Saradomin]] and insert gemstones into them:

# Whispering Swamp: The statue is in the north-west corner of the swamp. The statue requires an [[opal]] to be inserted in exchange for the [[opal emblem]]
# Fractured Plains: The statue is in the central portion of the plains, east of the tower and west of a lake, on the lower side of a small cliff. The statue requires a jade to be inserted in exchange for the [[jade emblem]]
# Stormtouched Highlands: The statue is in the north-east portion of the highlands, along the cliff edge. The statue requires a sapphire to be inserted in exchange for the [[sapphire emblem]].

Once all emblems are collected, return to the statue to receive a [[Saradominist cloak]].

